From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:12:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: expose a static macOS keyboard layout

Expose navigator.keyboard on secure windows with a read-only iterable
KeyboardLayoutMap. Use the existing frame policy helper for keyboard-map
and leave input dispatch, fullscreen, and Keyboard Lock unchanged.

Derive the 47 unmodified letter, digit, and punctuation entries from
Chromium 155.0.8059.40 kWritingSystemKeyDomCodes and VS Code en.darwin.ts
(com.apple.keylayout.US). The static U.S. ANSI persona does not query a
host layout or claim an exact macOS capture of international entries or
Blink iteration order.
---
